        "comment": "SOFT OTHER COPY COSTS. Permanent, required accounting entry. Aggregates +20 Points for every Skyweaver, Voidweaver, or Starweaver copy beyond the selected Game Size's 1/2/3 normal allowance. The player-facing rule is linked from the Game System.\nERROR TEMPLATE: automatic_configuration_duplicate. The roster max-1 constraint is intentionally omitted so New Recruit does not emit 'selections too many of Additional Copy Costs'. A custom error explains that the entry is automatic and how to repair it. The min-1 constraint remains for now so deleting the accounting entry cannot silently remove copy-cost surcharges.\nCONFIGURATION VALIDATION: this entry carries its own duplicate custom error. Its former stock roster min constraint is removed; missing-entry validation is owned by Army > Configuration in Game System revision 10 via the hidden Required Additional Copy Costs Configuration category."
